  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The permission hereby granted shall be for a limited period expiring on 05/11/2026, when the use shall cease and the site restored to its former condition.\r\n\r\nReason: The proposal is not considered suitable as a permanent form of development to safeguard neighbours' living conditions and the character and appearance of the area. ",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with:\r\n\r\nDocuments received on 10/07/2025\r\n579-PTA-ZZ-00-DR-A-1000 Rev P04 (Site Location Plan); Cover Letter dated 10/07/2025, by WSP  \r\n\r\nDocument received on 27/08/2025\r\nTransport Consultation Responses (further details to TFL and LBH Transport's comments) dated 27/08/2025, by WSP\r\n\r\nDocument received on 29/10/2025\r\nProposed Layout dated 28.10.25 Rev 03 \r\n \r\n\r\nReason: To ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission, a satisfactory standard of development is secured, and to allow the local planning authority to review any potential changes to the scheme.",
    "Condition : 3 - Car parking provision Ref: P/2025/2163\r\n\r\nThe total car parking provision for the development shall not exceed the existing parking spaces of 210 parking spaces.  \r\n\r\nReason: To ensure that the level of car parking provision aligns with the approved transport assessment and to prevent excessive vehicle trips. \r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - Condition Cycle storage\r\n\r\nThe cycle storage facilities shall be fully implemented in accordance with drawing no. Proposed Layout dated 28.10.25 Rev 03, made securely available for use, and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction.\r\n\r\nReason: To support sustainable transport objectives.\r\n"
  ],
